Generic single-database configuration.

The schema contains 13 tables: users, student_profiles, cvs, career_categories,
career_roles, skills, profile_strengths, profile_skills, career_role_skills,
cv_experiences, cv_educations, analyses, and analysis_skill_gaps.

Set DATABASE_URL in .env to a MySQL 8 connection using the PyMySQL driver and
utf8mb4, then run:

    alembic upgrade head

The latest migration normalizes existing profile strengths and self-assessed
skills, preserving existing values. Existing target_role_id values without a
matching role are retained as imported placeholder career roles.